{"id":"628274","name":"茴香馅儿生煎包","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/628274/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉馅","amount":"100g"},{"name":"茴香","amount":"100g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"10g"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"10g"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"5g"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"3g"},{"name":"姜粉","amount":"15g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"3g"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉酵母温水和面。","img":"images/628274/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"调成絮状。","img":"images/628274/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成面团盖盖子醒发。","img":"images/628274/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肉馅加姜粉、盐、蚝油、生抽、老抽、料酒、胡椒粉、十三香、糖拌匀。","img":"images/628274/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切茴香。","img":"images/628274/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切葱。","img":"images/628274/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"葱和茴香加油，拌入肉馅。","img":"images/628274/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌上劲。","img":"images/628274/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切香葱。","img":"images/628274/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉面团。","img":"images/628274/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分剂子。","img":"images/628274/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/628274/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包成小包子。","img":"images/628274/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"锅热倒油放包子。","img":"images/628274/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"中火包子底部上色后加入一小碗冷水盖锅盖焖五分钟。","img":"images/628274/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"撒芝麻香葱出锅。一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/628274/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}